5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe everyone's communication patterns. Let's keep the conversation open and see who tries to lead the narrative too early.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I'll be watching everyone closely. If anyone acts weird or tries to hide something, I'll be the first to call them out!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"This is so exciting! I wonder who the werewolf is? Hehe, let's all be friends while we figure it out together!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A sensible start, Asuka. I shall play the role of the observer for now. I'm curious to see whose mask slips first while we maintain this civility.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with the approach of observation. Let us remain calm and objective. Does anyone have a specific method for identifying the werewolf they wish to share?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll be looking for contradictions in statements. Logic is more reliable than intuition in a game of deception.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need fancy logic! I'll just trust my gut and see who's acting nervous. @Mio, you're awfully happy, aren't you?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, I'm just excited to play! Being happy isn't a crime, right? I'm just being myself!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, relying solely on ""gut feelings"" is a dangerous gamble. However, Mio's energy is certainly a stark contrast to the rest of us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Energy can be a mask, but so can silence. I will be paying attention to who agrees with whom too quickly.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, that's a keen observation. Mirroring is a common tactic for the Possessed to blend in.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Mirroring? What's that? I'll just keep being me! I'm not copying anyone!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Hehe, Takumi is so funny! I think we should all just trust each other for now. It'll be more fun that way!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford, Mio. I prefer to analyze the gaps between what is said and what is intended.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,Precisely. We must maintain a balance between cooperation and vigilance.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I believe we have established our general approach. I'll retire for the night.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
