36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first night has passed. If the Seer has information and feels it is safe to share, now would be the time.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Did the Seer find anything?! Come on, tell us! I want to know who the bad guy is!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I hope the Seer found someone nice! @Shion, you're so quiet, did you find anything interesting?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, your curiosity is quite pointed. To answer the group: yes, I have information. I can confirm that Mio is the werewolf.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Minako,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Shion. Are you officially claiming the Seer role?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, claiming the werewolf on day one is a high-risk, high-reward strategy. If you are the Seer, you've given us a clear target. If not, you're attempting a power play.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Mio is the wolf?! No way, she's too cheerful! Are you sure, @Shion?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mio,,@Shion! That's mean! Why would you say that? I'm just a regular girl! I'm not a werewolf!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"My vision is clear, Mio. Your cheerfulness is merely a veil for your appetite. I am indeed the Seer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Minako,,We must consider the possibility that Shion is the werewolf attempting to eliminate a villager by framing Mio.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako is right. We have no way to verify Shion's role other than his word. However, the timing is decisive.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't know who to believe! Mio seems nice, but Shion sounds so sure! This is confusing!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Please don't believe him! I'm innocent! @Minako, you're the smartest, you don't believe him, right?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, appealing to emotion is the last refuge of the guilty. The facts remain: I saw your true nature.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I am weighing the options. Shion's confidence is compelling, but Mio's reaction is exactly what a werewolf would do.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"Without a counter-claim from another Seer, Shion's information is our only lead. I am inclined to trust the Seer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I guess I'll go with Shion. Sorry, Mio, but he sounds like he knows what he's talking about!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mio,,I can't believe this! You're all making a huge mistake! I'm not the wolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The truth is often unwelcome, but necessary. I suggest we proceed with the vote.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I will also vote for Mio. If Shion is lying, we can analyze the results tomorrow.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
